ns in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O7iAY2Hr0FUQ7kNvwG02qwh&_nc_oc=AdofXYG6GxhBsnwUeLf9KIBoyZBVLJjU0LDgKfzYipnf1i4hAOG42xwo2gdZzRvE6-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKsxVX_RcMTsIDzPG1NTvRhlDjND7a356lzpleYp5KzqA&oe=6AA41D03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wujhwHWL3nYQ7kNvwEZo3zR&_nc_oc=Ado9MpHAMLQtY75aBvt2efD9DlYB-r3Ma9VBq4ZzWzvnKlxkQlVqcAcDpbZrZb0x4sk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIXLI6M2Bo76Rz4YIJx413wripDHgge670fgXt_KGqpWw&oe=6AA41558"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vMemvpPmMdkQ7kNvwFu9l3i&_nc_oc=Adr5HQ8WDH17HEYTXBs9_HHlMAqIG3H2vivet_IJUFMz1uNLQlrnPv8T4rPDGQiCp8U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJJbWPs8lxZ1cIrK1ufHZJS2iLj3qFfZS810ixcCS2u7g&oe=6AA3F03C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_13386805878482